172	     * Derives an owner's age band from its birth date, computed as the owner's age on its
173	     * {@link Owner#getRegistrationDate() registration date}: {@code "MINOR"} when under {@code 18},
174	     * {@code "ADULT"} when {@code 18} to {@code 64}, and {@code "SENIOR"} when {@code 65} or older.
175	     * Returns {@code null} when the owner has no birth date, so the field is omitted from the
176	     * response.
177	     *
178	     * @param owner the owner to derive the age band for
179	     * @return {@code "MINOR"}, {@code "ADULT"} or {@code "SENIOR"}, or {@code null} when no birth date
180	     *     is held
