474	    /**
475	     * Derives an owner's fiscal year, formatted {@code FY<YY>} where {@code YY} is the last two
476	     * digits (zero-padded) of the fiscal year that the owner's business-day-adjusted registration
477	     * date falls in. The fiscal year starts on 1 July and is labelled by the calendar year in which
478	     * it ends, so a registration date on or after 1 July belongs to the next year's fiscal year
479	     * (e.g. {@code 2026-08-11 -> FY27}, {@code 2026-01-05 -> FY26}).
480	     *
481	     * @param owner the owner to derive the fiscal year for
482	     * @return the formatted fiscal year
483	     */
